---
import { BaseSchema } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "amaan khan | about";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
	<p>
		i am currently a master's student studying cybersecurity engineering at washu (in st. louis). 
		i also completed my undergrad at washu, where i majored in computer science. broadly, my research interests lie in creating 
		safe, secure, and robust autonomous systems. i've had the privilege of exploring these interests deeply through my 
		involvement in <a href="https://engineering.washu.edu/faculty/Hussein-Sibai.html" target="_blank">prof. hussein sibai's</a> research group. 
		so far, i've primarily worked on developing novel conformal perception contracts for occupancy-based safe planning in 
		autonomous driving settings.
	</p>
	<p>
		<i>
			this website was written in <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank">astro</a> and deployed on <a href="https://vercel.com/" target="_blank">vercel</a>; it's been
			a fun and pragmatic way to pick up some web development skills. here's the <a href="https://github.com/amaan-19/website" target="_blank">source code</a> if you're interested.
		</i>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>